\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 **Galactic Conglomerate**\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 Galactic is an influential multi-sectoral corporation that has shaped The Convergence in myriad ways. It is a corporate behemoth with diverse arms that encompass sectors such as shipbuilding, resource extraction, agriculture, manufacturing, transportation, entertainment, education, healthcare, and research.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Galactic Galleons** is the shipbuilding arm of the conglomerate. They are responsible for the construction of some of the most sophisticated and safest starships in The Convergence. Their craftsmanship is widely recognized as top-tier, with the safety of their ships making them the preferred choice for many travelers.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Galactic Gold Trust** is the resource storage and exchange division of the conglomerate. They deal in the exchange of valuable resources, using a standard based on rare and precious materials such as Neutronium and Quark Matter, materials that retain their value even on an intergalactic scale.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Galactic Geodes** is the resource exploration and extraction division. They have honed their techniques to an art form, able to locate and extract resources with efficiency and minimal environmental impact.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Galactic Greens** is the agricultural arm, responsible for the production of consumables for the conglomerate's employees and external markets. Their reach extends across various market planets, providing food and other consumables to countless individuals.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Galactic Gearworks**, the manufacturing arm, is known for producing high-quality tools and equipment. Their products are used widely within the conglomerate and are also sold to external customers on certain market planets.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Galactic Getaways**, the tourism and hospitality division, operates some of the most luxurious and well-equipped ships in The Convergence. Their voyages are considered the pinnacle of intergalactic tourism, with some of their ships serving as orbiting hotels and casinos in special vista locations.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Galactic Gala** is the entertainment production arm of the conglomerate. They produce a vast array of entertainment options, catering to the diverse tastes of The Convergence's inhabitants. Their media empire stretches across various platforms, offering something for everyone.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Galactic Guidance** is the educational division of the conglomerate. They provide education to all children of Galactic employees and offer supplemental instruction to employees, fostering a culture of continuous learning and improvement.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Galactic Genomics** is the healthcare division. While they have struggled to make significant breakthroughs in recent years, they remain renowned for their pioneering work in genetic modifications. These modifications, essential for humans to survive the harsh environments of space, generate recurring revenue for the conglomerate as they cannot be passed down through birth.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 **Galactic Genesis** is the research and development division of the conglomerate. Much of their work is shrouded in secrecy, but rumors persist that they possess technology centuries ahead of common-tech.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \strokec4 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb3 \strokec2 In its totality, the Galactic Conglomerate is a testament to the potential of human ingenuity and ambition. Their influence extends across The Convergence, shaping the lives of countless individuals and the trajectories of numerous civilizations.\cb1 \
}